# DUSA's music where CCE plays its own one-off tracks (docs/music.md).
#
# The disc (Makefile DUSA_TRACKS, tools/mkdisc.py --from) puts DUSA's
# tracks in place of three of CCE's: Victory Lane (DUSA 19) in track 21,
# which the name entry (NAME.BIN 0602A0FC) and the two-player result
# (RESULT2P.BIN 0602801E) already loop, so they need nothing here; Pounding
# Pavement's goal and ending in 19 and 22. DUSA's Pounding Pavement is
# track 37, with the other '95 songs (34-36), so a range of tracks plays
# them in turn.
#
# The replay (RACE.BIN 0602950A, at the race start, looped through
# 06030C5A) played track 19, CCE's The American Dream: now 37, Pounding
# Pavement '95.
DAYTONA/RACE.BIN 0602950A 06028000 e413 e425

# The staff roll (ENDING.BIN 06028092, played once) played track 22, CCE's
# Crash & Burrn: now 37, Pounding Pavement '95.
DAYTONA/ENDING.BIN 06028092 06028000 e416 e425

# The sound test's track list (SLCT.BIN 0603FCF8, a byte an entry) until it
# gets DUSA's names: The American Dream (entry 26) and Crash & Burrn (29)
# play what the replay and the staff roll play now. Sunset on the DAYTONA
# Beach (28) plays track 21, Victory Lane now.
DAYTONA/SLCT.BIN 0603FD12 06028000 13 25
DAYTONA/SLCT.BIN 0603FD15 06028000 16 25
